# 构建产物
dist/
.astro/

# demo：CI/本地构建时从 apps/quiz-app 拷入的静态产物（wayfinder #12）
public/demo/

# docs 同步产物：由 scripts/sync-docs.mjs 从仓库根 docs/ 生成（真源在 docs/）
src/content/docs/method/
src/content/docs/ai/
src/content/docs/maintain/
src/content/docs/changelog.md

# 依赖
node_modules/
# docs 四语同步产物：en/es/ru 译本同样由 sync-docs.mjs 从 docs/<name>.<lang>.md 生成
src/content/docs/*/method/
src/content/docs/*/ai/
src/content/docs/*/maintain/
